      <MissionDesc>Students Without Limits addresses the on-going crisis impacting thousands of underserved immigrant youth in San Diego who are filled with fear about their future and traumatized by the separation from their parents due to sweeping changes in US Immigration policies. By delivering direct and remote services in underserved schools across San Diego County through legal, mental health and continuing education support. SWOLs unique three-pronged approach provides students and their families a greater understanding and knowledge of their legal rights and options, improved quality of life by learning positive coping skills and a greater possibility of these students graduating high school, attending college and becoming meaningful contributors to the San Diego community and beyond.</MissionDesc>
